# SOLO-2 · A solo in a folder without git.
start
see any key: close
key Escape
type :solo $ACC_CASE/repos/plain claude:haiku
key Enter
see ⌀ no git
key /
type add a line to notes.txt
key Enter
key Escape Escape
wait 30 Changed notes.txt.
sh grep -c 'add a line' repos/plain/notes.txt
type :commit
key Enter
see git
type :open $ACC_CASE/repos/plain
key Enter
see git
